    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a \"block\" though. it feels deeper. like the well is actually dry. for years i thought the work was what made me \"me,\" but now that it's gone, there's nothing left. just this shell. it feels more like a conclusion than a phase. like the story is just finished, and i'm just... lingering.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
